Package: cvrr
Title: Danish and Greenlandic Annual Report Filings from the CVR
    Distribution Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A complete route from a list of CVR numbers to analysable
    accounting data. Search Erhvervsstyrelsens free distribution service
    for the annual reports a set of companies has published, download the
    documents, and read the machine-readable ones: a directory of XBRL
    filings becomes one tibble with a row per reported fact, resolved
    against the taxonomy that gives each fact its label, its place in the
    statement and its sign convention. From there a set of tables -- the
    company, where it is, how it was audited, its income statement, its
    balance sheet, its fixed asset note, what management wrote, and whether
    any of it adds up -- each opening with the same key columns.
    Greenlandic companies are covered by the same
    register and the same taxonomy as Danish ones. Amounts in a filing
    often arrive without a meaningful sign, so a reconciliation solver
    recovers the signs that make the line items sum to the reported total.
